  "body": "Per @rwlbuis at https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/20930#issuecomment-570176420 browsers use the MIME type parser for `<link type>`. This is different from `<style>` (see #3022) and is also not currently spelled out in the standard. It ought to be.\r\n\r\nArguably it's reasonable for it to be different as we only use it as a \"hint\" as to whether to fetch the resource, but mostly it seems easier to accept that it ended up this way and codify it rather than try to change it and break sites.",
